- Last successful discovery time.
- Number of tables and views discovered.

Do not claim that schema discovery succeeded until the actual metadata request succeeds.

Keep the existing `/health` and all working Step 1 endpoints operational.

Use suitable HTTP status codes and the project's existing response conventions.

